{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b28cf5e8b67062439aa6b0616e0d3de7c8101becd1d5c083bd9bd52947f0c7f", "ja": "（昴の新しい衣装が完成し、試着してもらっている。\n着替え終わったみたいだから、少し声をかけてくるか）", "zh": "（昴的新服装已经完成，现在正让她试穿。她好像已经换好了，我去跟她说句话吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "1a65edf5c6a5c007afe3d4b1b2d09d50b87eac1a5aa21b696b87983d3c1f7508", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}、見てよ！\nこの衣装、いいよなー。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，你看！\n这套服装很不错吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "c97f95ab288a0ea22e273248e78476d6ddc55a5ce915ab3a6086419164bb7b0d", "ja": "かわいすぎて、オレなんかが着ていいのか\nちょっと不安だけど……メチャクチャ気に入ったよ！", "zh": "太可爱了，像我这种人穿真的没问题吗？虽然有点不安……但我特别喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b528626469929eb7a4b7c7f686654ab218dedf076f31f568e34cbf0ec9d3e127", "ja": "大丈夫、凄く似合ってるよ。\nみんなに見てもらうのが、今から楽しみだな！", "zh": "没问题，非常适合你哦。\n我已经开始期待让大家看一看啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "9fe94a87c0defc91129f54ded8b471ea655849efdcb290989868765a7c664bee", "ja": "へへっ。けど、最初は驚いたんだぜ？\n龍の神様をイメージしたって言ってたからさー。", "zh": "嘿嘿。不过，一开始我可是吓了一跳啊？\n因为你说是以龙神为灵感的嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "331a72d83c0e41cb40efccf33cfe2f6942e205d3c0ba32ad7c2199b407ab6e04", "ja": "カッコいい感じなんだろうなーって思ったら、\nすっげーかわいいんだもん！", "zh": "我还以为会是那种很帅的感觉呢，\n结果居然超级可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8ada131dffc9d6e8594cc99e23e6d525f358fef63b539de8c8248448539fee16", "ja": "たしかに、龍って聞いたら強いイメージだよな。\nでも、昴が演じる龍神は、親しみやすさがウリなんだ。", "zh": "确实，一听到龙，就会觉得很强大吧。\n不过，昴饰演的龙神，卖点是亲和力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "b2163123b7f15c82adeb92e01a8a1baa55fd9babf57bf500f085a01b76ad9880", "ja": "うん。オレも台本読んだけどさ。\nまぁカッコいいって感じじゃなかったかな。", "zh": "嗯，我也读过剧本了。不过嘛，感觉并不是那种很帅气的类型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "229505be4483b5c8dfb628149d6830a6cd6a0193d6e740c82d992ff5e3e04e36", "ja": "でも村の人たちには慕われてたし……\nあの神様、すっげーいい子だよな！", "zh": "不过他也很受村民们爱戴……\n那个神明真是个特别好的孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cb9fbe5b3d5cb25b89260fb101cbb86ecebb63e9c66766e06498a482741f81e5", "ja": "いい子って……。一応、神様だけどな……。", "zh": "好孩子啊……话虽如此，人家好歹也是神明吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "be64bb71f83a49e217e1e0bcc2da0bc479d13443dfb15cc3afc72bc8d8880ecb", "ja": "にしても、親しみやすさかー……\nなんかちょっと、アイドルに似てるかも。", "zh": "不过，要说亲和力嘛——……\n感觉好像和偶像有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e6472ef1f561c905f611c35bbd34af3deb480eb619950230d00a51fb3a7ebd7e", "ja": "アイドルに？", "zh": "偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "ea6b6a5e40b9f7755febc0ac20efb32576dda88a87e8ea650d6b6c5da1e34622", "ja": "うん。オレさ……ファンのみんなとは、\nいつも近い距離でいたいって思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。我啊……一直都希望能和大家的距离更近一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4a266592c2d8440188bf93bd48bfea47a2cdc26f8718ee03832f7998da07320", "ja": "オレの好きなアイドルも、そういう子が多かったし\n……親しみやすさって、結構大事なのかなって。", "zh": "我喜欢的偶像也有很多是那样的……\n所以我觉得，亲和力还是很重要的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b092b84faf32880db81105455c61ec22f4748e67ac315b945f9694240dfb6ba9", "ja": "そうだな。身近に感じる分、\nより相手のことを応援したくなるんだろうな。", "zh": "是啊。正因为会觉得对方就在身边，才会更想为对方加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "70140407ac0aa20ced26a0a315bc4839d7f3fa8c03c944221c6d027e98870d6c", "ja": "そうそう！　もちろん、\nスターとかカリスマとかもカッコいいけど！", "zh": "没错没错！当然啦，\n明星或是魅力非凡的人也很帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "6ec0dba6ccbd0cb21822fedd9b369808a33f15e9b6f5878b4daa25bd5ae1b0ae", "ja": "んー、オレも、みんなに親しまれるように\n何かした方がいいかな～？", "zh": "嗯——我也该做点什么，\n好让大家更容易亲近吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1017_p", "source_sha256": "00f2b65637ccbe6efab1e957cc2ad4d7a0a240339ead62bd9930db35330e5b9d", "ja": "いや。昴は今でも充分、親しみやすいと思うよ。\nそのまま真っ直ぐ全力で、アイドルを続けてほしい！", "zh": "不。昴现在就已经很平易近人了。\n希望你就这样一直直来直往、全力以赴地当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "3c6c9a56025717906253f667fc93ea228541a43b332bf2068ddcf842ecd0c7bf", "ja": "真っ直ぐ全力……えへへ、ストレートなら任せろ～！\nど真ん中に投げてやるぜ！", "zh": "笔直全力……嘿嘿，要说直球就包在我身上～！\n我会朝正中间投过去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0484_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "9b8d273a230ac91cdf6d2bf149a1aa9790a3248579dd32e75fc8c6e6de5704e2", "ja": "見ててくれよな、{$P$}！\n親しみやすい神様、絶対ものにしてみせるからさ♪", "zh": "你看好了，{$P$}！\n平易近人的神明，我一定会拿下的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
